5,1,1,talk,May,,Hi everyone! That room is such a mess of purposes right now. Let's figure out what it should actually be for so we can stop the chaos!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. It's become too cluttered to be useful for anything. We should look at the data before we decide on a new purpose.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to see you all. A space should serve the people, not the other way around. Let us be mindful of the effort required.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I'm so excited! I want to find a way to make the room super fun for everyone! What should we check first?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I think we need a place where we can actually talk to each other. Let's see how we've been using the space lately!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"I want to know who's actually using it and who's cleaning up. I'll check the ""Fortnight's tally of use by person"" and ""Final clear-out of the old fridge""!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I'm interested in the environment. I'll look into ""The partition wall to the office"" and ""Crumbs and bins at the desks.""","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,"I shall examine the ""Facilities callouts on this floor"" and ""Round trip for a hot lunch"" to see where our time and energy are spent.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"I want to see the money stuff! I'll check ""Invoices for outside hire by the hour"" and ""Quotes for the two fit-outs""!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'll look at ""Unplanned talk since the refit"" and ""Where the last awkward conversation happened"" to see how we're communicating.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,"@Sakura, do you think the cost of fitting it out will be a big deal? I hope we don't spend too much!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"Cost is one thing, but the daily impact on those of us sitting nearby is another. We can't ignore the noise.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, Misaki. The quiet rhythms of a workday are easily disrupted. We must seek a balance that preserves peace.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"I just want it to be awesome! If we spend a little now, maybe we won't have to pay for other rooms later!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I agree with Servas about the rhythm, but I think we're missing a place for the ""real"" talks. I hope the data shows that!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,"Well, we have our list! Let's go find the answers and come back to decide. See you all soon!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Misaki,,Agreed. I'll see you in the next round.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Servas,,I look forward to our findings. Until then.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm on it! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Let's do this! See you later!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
