34,2,,status,Kenji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,May,,"Wow, it's so unfair! Only two people are using the room most of the time, and one person is doing all the fridge cleaning!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"It's worse than I thought. The wall is basically paper; you can hear everything. And people are eating at their desks, leaving crumbs everywhere.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It seems we spend a great deal of time walking for food, yet the room itself requires very little technical maintenance.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Sakura,,Guess what! We've been spending a ton of money on outside rentals for tiny meetings! And the fit-out quotes are actually pretty reasonable.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"It's kind of sad. We barely talk unless it's by the printer, and the last time someone had a problem, they had to say it in front of everyone.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, if people are eating at their desks, maybe we need a proper place for food? But I don't want one person stuck cleaning it.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, a kitchen might just bring more noise and smells right next to my desk. The sound issue is the biggest problem for me.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,"If the walk for lunch is twenty-five minutes, a kitchen would save many hours of labor over a year. That is a significant gift of time.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Kenji, that sounds so awkward! If we had a meeting space, you wouldn't have to have those conversations in front of everyone, right?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"Exactly, Sakura! We need a place for private talks. Right now, we're basically strangers who happen to work in the same room.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,"@Sakura, how much are those outside rentals? If we're paying 68,000 yen, maybe a meeting room is the smartest move for the budget.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"A meeting room would still be noisy if the walls are that thin. We need to consider if a ""Quiet Room"" would be better for everyone's sanity.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,"A quiet room offers peace, but a meeting space offers connection. We must decide if we value silence or the ability to resolve conflicts.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"The rentals are expensive! And a meeting room fit-out is 141,000 yen. It might pay for itself really quickly!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, I understand the noise, but if we have a dedicated space for meetings, we can keep the ""awkward"" stuff out of the main office.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,"It sounds like we're torn between food, silence, and talking. Let's see what the official options are!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"I'm still worried about the noise, but I'm listening.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us see which path leads to the most harmony.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I can't wait to see the options! This is like a puzzle!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm hoping for something that brings us together.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
