60,3,1,talk,May,,"Okay, the options are an Open Kitchen, a Quiet Room, or a Meeting Space. I'm leaning toward the Meeting Space to stop the rental costs!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Misaki,,A Quiet Room is the only one that solves the noise and mess issues. I can't handle more crumbs or loud phone calls next to me.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Servas,,"The Open Kitchen would save us so much walking time. However, the Meeting Space addresses the social fragmentation Kenji mentioned.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"I love the idea of a kitchen, but the money for outside rentals is crazy! A Meeting Space seems like the most ""grown-up"" choice.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"A Meeting Space is perfect! It solves the ""printer talk"" problem and gives us a place for those difficult conversations.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, would a Meeting Space be too loud? Or would it be better than people just talking across their desks?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"It would still be loud, but at least it's contained. However, a Quiet Room would be a true sanctuary. I really prefer Option B.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Misaki, peace is a virtue, but isolation can be a burden. If we choose the Quiet Room, we continue to be strangers.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Misaki, please think about the rentals! We're wasting so much money! Option C is the best for the club's wallet!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, if we have a Meeting Space, we can set rules about noise. But if we have a Quiet Room, we still have nowhere to actually talk.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,May,,"I'm sold on Option C. It's professional, it saves money, and it gives us a place to actually coordinate.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"I see the logic, but my daily experience is the one being sacrificed. Still, I can't argue with the financial waste Sakura found.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Servas,,I find myself agreeing with the majority. The social need for a meeting space outweighs the convenience of a kitchen.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Sakura,,Yay! I'm voting for Option C! Let's stop paying those outside companies and have our own cool space!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm definitely voting for Option C. It's the only way we'll stop being strangers.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,May,,It looks like we have a consensus! I'm voting for Option C.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Misaki,,"For the sake of the budget and the group, I will concede. I vote for Option C.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Servas,,I shall support the collective will. I vote for Option C.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Sakura,,Option C all the way! I vote C!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm so happy! I vote for Option C!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
